hub.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/945#issuecomment-628207467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/945","id":628207467,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyODIwNzQ2Nw==","user":{"login":"andrewjskatz","id":2134649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewjskatz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewjskatz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-13T19:46:17Z","updated_at":"2020-05-13T19:46:17Z","body":"@jlovejoy you can see why this is a reason we have removed the formatting in version 2.1. I was inspired by the canonical version of Apache 2.0 does contain formatting https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 but I can in no way blame ASF for my own idiocy.\r\n\r\nThere are two options I can propose. I can either mark up the formatting as *bold* and +italic+ - I'm happy to provide a file to do that (but I'm slightly worried that in some circumstances the * and + might be interpreted as break characters and cause odd things to happen in text editors or IDEs, or I would alter the preamble so it reads:\r\n\r\nIf your copy of this document has some words in italics, these are intended indicate changes from the Apache License, but are indicative and not to be taken into account in interpretation.\r\n\r\n(originally  \r\n\r\nWords in italics indicate changes rom the Apache License, but are indicative and not to be taken into account in interpretation.\r\n)\r\n\r\nAnd then I will insert quotes around the emboldened definitions. \r\n\r\nNeither of these changes have any effect on the legal meaning of the document, so I'm reasonably comfortable making them. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/628207467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/628709386","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/945#issuecomment-628709386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/945","id":628709386,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyODcwOTM4Ng==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-14T15:26:38Z","updated_at":"2020-05-14T15:26:38Z","body":"@jlovejoy @andrewjskatz I'd suggest we just merge #1029 as-is, with the license in plain text since that's the only thing the license list can render.\r\n\r\nAnd then (maybe as a follow-up PR) we add to the notes for SHL-2.0 a statement making it clear that the italics referenced in the license cannot be displayed in the version on the license list, but can be seen on the license steward's site. Would you be okay with that?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/628709386/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/629385400","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/945#issuecomment-629385400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/945","id":629385400,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyOTM4NTQwMA==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user